{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalInstantonExists","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalInstantonExists","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.Instanton","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Preadditive.Basic"],"declarations":1,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalInstanton.exists","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalInstanton.exists","kind":"theorem","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-instanton-exists.lean#L26-L50","doc":"**Existence of categorical instantons.**\n\nIn a preadditive monoidal category `C`, for any Frobenius–Hopf object and\nany `q`-Hodge involution `⋆_q` on `A`, there exists a\n`CategoricalInstanton fh` whose curvature is the **zero** morphism — the\nzero-instanton `F_∇ = 0`, which is `⋆_q`-self-dual because `0 ≫ ⋆_q = 0`.\n\nThis replaces the earlier `Nonempty (CategoricalInstanton fh)` proved by an\n*identity*-curvature witness (whose self-duality reduced to the trivial\n`𝟙 ≫ 𝟙 = 𝟙`): the existential now pins the witness to the genuine\n`F_∇ = 0` zero-instanton named in [`prop:categorical-instanton-exists`],\nso self-duality is the real `0 ≫ ⋆_q = 0`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:categorical-instanton-exists","label":"prop:categorical-instanton-exists","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-instanton-exists.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}